# Prevent Vercel from auto-detecting app/ Python files as serverless function
# endpoints. Vercel creates a function for every .py file it finds, including
# app/app.py, which has no requirements.txt so all packages are missing.
# NOTE: "includeFiles": "app/**" in vercel.json overrides .vercelignore for
# the purpose of *bundling* these files into api/index.py's Lambda — they are
# still importable at runtime, just not served as standalone function routes.
app/*.py
app/**/*.py

